    featuredImagePrompt: "An infographic-style visual depicting the convergence of natural elements (e.g., stylized plant leaves, berries, or microbial structures) and artificial intelligence (represented by neural network patterns, glowing data streams, or robotic hands). In the center, a simplified diagram or icon representing the GLP-1 receptor or metabolic pathways, with arrows illustrating 'natural activation' facilitated by AI. The overall aesthetic should be modern, clean, and scientific, using a palette of greens, blues, and subtle digital glows to convey innovation and nature, optimized for Google Discover with clear, distinct elements.",
