    featuredImagePrompt: "A breathtaking wide-angle scene of deep space. In the foreground, a faint, solitary probe (like Voyager 1) appears as a tiny, distant speck, emitting a subtle, almost imperceptible signal. In the mid-ground, a glowing, highly detailed spiral galaxy (representing the Milky Way) is partially obscured by faint, wispy, luminous nebulae, hinting at hidden structures. Distant, small, irregular dwarf galaxies are barely visible as faint, ethereal smudges around the main galaxy. The overall mood is one of immense scale, profound discovery, and the lonely, persistent journey of exploration across cosmic distances. High resolution, scientific accuracy, realistic lighting, deep field perspective, minimal light pollution, cosmic dust trails.",
