    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, high-resolution, industry-specific visual. On the left, a sleek, modern, slightly abstract representation of Silicon Valley architecture – towering glass buildings with subtle digital network lines. On the right, contrasting, a classical, imposing government building facade with American flags, symbolizing Washington D.C. In the foreground, spanning between these two distinct landscapes, a turbulent, digitally rendered sea or river, with abstract, metallic-sheen 'tech giant' chess pieces (like a stylized knight or bishop) navigating the choppy waters. The overall mood should be one of tension and transition, illustrating the 'tricky political waters' for tech billionaires. The lighting is dramatic, with a clear sky on the political side and gathering clouds over the tech side, reflecting a shift in power. Ensure the image is unique, not generic stock, and avoids direct caricatures of real people, focusing on the thematic clash of industry and government power. Include subtle hints of global connections, perhaps faint lines extending from the tech side towards a world map.",
