    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the convergence of advanced medical technologies: on the left, an abstract, glowing neural network symbolizing AI, intricately connected to a double helix DNA strand on the right, where tiny, precise edits are visibly highlighted. In the background, subtle, blurred human figures with expressions of hope and relief, hinting at the fight against neurodegenerative diseases like dementia. The color palette should be futuristic and clean, with blues, greens, and subtle purples. The composition should convey innovation, precision, and a hopeful future for health, avoiding any literal depiction of disease or suffering.",
