    featuredImagePrompt: "A highly conceptual and impactful visual representing global warming. Show a stylized Earth, glowing with intense, fiery reds and oranges at its core, radiating outwards. Around the Earth, subtle, abstract representations of extreme weather phenomena: a faint, swirling hurricane pattern, delicate cracks symbolizing drought, and a hazy, heat-distorted atmosphere. The overall composition should be dark and moody, with the Earth as the central, alarming focal point, conveying urgency and crisis. The style should be modern, digital art with a slightly ominous feel, avoiding any literal thermometers or melting ice caps to ensure uniqueness.",
