    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout showcasing a vibrant, split image. One side depicts abstract, glowing neural networks and futuristic AI interfaces, symbolizing innovation and breakthroughs. The other side shows a graph with a slightly declining trend or a cautious market indicator, with subtle political symbols (like a blurred election ballot or legislative building) in the background, representing the post-midterm reality and potential spending stalls. In the foreground, subtle icons representing major tech companies like Anthropic and OpenAI are visible, signifying their IPO impact. The overall tone is dynamic yet balanced, reflecting both optimism and caution. Use a clean, modern design suitable for a financial news publication like PulseTrends.in. The composition should clearly differentiate the two themes of progress and market reality.",
