      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A neutral-to-bearish outlook appears most probable. While Binance has a strong track record and resources, a $6.3 billion hack is an unprecedented challenge. The immediate resumption of withdrawals is positive, but the long-term impact on user trust and regulatory relationships will be significant. The probability of a full, swift recovery without substantial long-term consequences is low, while a complete collapse is also unlikely given Binance\'s scale. Expect a protracted period of rebuilding trust and navigating heightened scrutiny.",
