    risks: ["**Operational Risk:** Potential for further system vulnerabilities during recovery and asset recovery challenges.", "**Regulatory Scrutiny:** Increased pressure from global regulators on exchange security, KYC/AML compliance, and state-sponsored illicit financing.", "**Reputational Damage:** Erosion of user trust and confidence, potentially impacting user acquisition and market share for Binance.", "**Market Volatility:** Short-term price fluctuations in major cryptocurrencies due to liquidation fears or broader sentiment shifts.", "**Decentralization vs. Centralization Debate:** Tensions between the ethos of censorship resistance in DeFi and centralized efforts to block illicit funds.", "**Persistent Threat:** Ongoing and evolving threat from state-sponsored cyberattacks targeting crypto infrastructure."],
