      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a 60% probability of continued short-term volatility and potential further downside if Middle East tensions escalate. A 30% probability of a gradual recovery as geopolitical fears subside and underlying institutional demand reasserts itself. A 10% probability of a significant upside breakout if a major de-escalation occurs and market sentiment rapidly improves.",
