    longTailKeywords: ["how to report crypto taxes to IRS with new program", "analysis of Initia blockchain $2.6 million exploit causes", "SEC\'s high-risk assessment for tokenization of real-world assets", "what are the regulatory challenges for crypto investors in India", "best practices for securing digital assets against blockchain hacks", "understanding the voluntary disclosure program for crypto tax compliance", "future of real-world asset tokenization under SEC scrutiny", "market impact of simultaneous crypto tax relief and security breaches"],
