    featuredImagePrompt: "A sophisticated conceptual visual representing the intertwined themes of cryptocurrency regulation, blockchain security, and financial disclosure. On one side, abstract legal symbols like digital scales of justice and a stylized government seal are subtly integrated into a flowing digital data stream. In the center, robust, interlocking blockchain ledger blocks form a protective shield, emanating secure green light. On the other side, a magnifying glass hovers over a transparent digital ledger, symbolizing tax disclosure and transparency. The overall aesthetic is clean, futuristic, with a professional, institutional financial intelligence platform feel. Use a palette of deep blues, emerald greens, and subtle silver/gold accents. No specific crypto logos or human figures.",
