    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split image. On the left, a close-up of a sleek, modern cryptocurrency hardware wallet (like a Ledger device) with a subtle, glowing, almost translucent circuit board implant visible beneath its screen, symbolizing tampering. Digital lock icons are shattered around it, and faint cryptocurrency symbols (Bitcoin, Ethereum) are in the background. On the right, a stylized political ballot box or a campaign poster with subtle blockchain elements, and an abstract, shadowy figure representing a PAC. Overlaid subtly on the entire image is a faint, glowing neural network or lines of code, signifying AI\'s involvement, perhaps with a small, stylized, thinking robot icon. The color palette should be professional, with contrasting tones for the two halves, evoking both security breach and political intrigue. The overall composition should be clean and impactful, suitable for a financial news publication.",
